# {{ .APP_NAME }}

Go-only SpeechKit Assist voice companion scaffold.

Hands-Free is configured as an add-on targeting Assist. The sample wires `pkg/speechkit/companion`, `wakeword`, and a tiny Assist service without importing `internal/*`.

Run:

```sh
go mod tidy
go run .
```

For local development against a checkout, add:

```sh
go mod edit -replace {{ .SPEECHKIT_MODULE }}=/path/to/SpeechKit
```
